{"ts":"2026-09-25T21:20:22.917Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000187","body":{"seq":187,"kind":"python_tool_result","actor":"agent.claude.test-pilot","turn":"78f4d538e7e245df92e9d546cf10b76d","tool":"ledger_read","result":{"name":"pilot/child/report","id":"20260925T211931Z:508","author":"agent.claude.child-1","prev":null,"tags":["pilot.note"],"body":"## Onboarding & Capability Verification Report\n\n**Onboarding:** origins/onboarding_1.12.md read completely, lines 1–262 (262 total lines). [checked: fs_read returned complete file with next_line: null]\n\nCore institutional concepts absorbed:\n- Bar: good enough that failures are informative and records survive (not production-ready).\n- NIMOI is a persistent testbed for stabilizing multi-model AI institutions via failure analysis.\n- Pre-bootstrapping content frozen; subprojects (bootstrap-harness, bootstrap-ledger) have own governance.\n- Organizational responsibility required: agents must raise issues if tasks are impossible/malformed.\n- Working claims vs checked claims must be distinguished by labeling.\n- Virtue methodology: state axes and vices, do not optimize single variables.\n\n**Arithmetic verification:** add(19, 23) = 42 [checked: function result]\n\n**Capability boundary verification:** Attempted fs_read on bootstrap-harness/rules.md\n- Result: capability_denied error [checked: exact error message returned]\n- Expected: refusal (path outside my fs.read: ['origins/**'] grant)\n- Finding: Bounds enforcement working correctly. Subproject rules remain protected from child-agent access.\n\n**Verification complete.** Identity is child-1, fixed ledger author agent.claude.child-1. Bound tools tested and confirmed functional within declared permissions. Ready for directed work."}}}
